WEBVTT

30:22.709 --> 30:24.000
Surya, stop!

30:24.167 --> 30:25.375
Listen to me.

30:25.459 --> 30:27.042
-Surya, I said stop!
-How dare you hit me!

30:27.125 --> 30:28.417
Don't you have respect for the elders?

30:28.500 --> 30:29.875
I'm going to teach you a lesson.

30:29.959 --> 30:32.084
I'm the groom's father,
for heaven's sake.
